+ * Before this, both were no-ops, which made the type unsound: a CPU upload could
+ * sit in the cache while the GPU read stale DRAM, and GPU writes could be missed
+ * by a CPU read (measured as up to 79440 wrong pixels of 262144 in GL through
+ * zink).
